            "fileSize": 190736071
          },
          "description": "Enter a world of imagination and enchantment at bedtime with this selection of timeless short stories by Enid Blyton. \n\nGet ready for a magical journey.... Set your imagination alight with this selection of more than 25 bedtime stories by a much-loved children's author. From pixie dressmakers to thundering giants, meet a host of magic and memorable characters along with some familiar friends in Moonface and Saucepan Man from The Magic Faraway Tree. \n\nThis stunning treasury brings together some of Enid Blyton's most delightful stories for younger children, creating the perfect bedtime treat. Each story stands alone and will take you on a brand-new adventure. The tales collected in this treasury were first published in magazines and anthologies between 1920 and 1960 and have been adored by generations of children ever since.",
          "author": "Enid Blyton",
